B.Of=new A.ae("\u2022 **Recency (R):** M\xfc\u015fterinin en son al\u0131\u015fveri\u015f yapma tarihi. Son al\u0131\u015fveri\u015fi yak\u0131nsa y\xfcksek puan al\u0131r (5), uzaksa d\xfc\u015f\xfck puan (1).\n\n\u2022 **Frequency (F):** Belirli bir s\xfcre i\xe7inde yap\u0131lan al\u0131\u015fveri\u015f say\u0131s\u0131. Daha s\u0131k al\u0131\u015fveri\u015f yapanlar daha y\xfcksek puan al\u0131r.\n\n\u2022 **Monetary (M):** Harcama miktar\u0131. Toplam harcama y\xfcksekse daha y\xfcksek puan verilir.",null,B.ad,null,null)
